{"title":"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/2/c024eea388ea2e4fecf4e7adfb927ebf6531369b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n)=\\frac{x_1+x_2+\\cdots +x_n}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"205\" height=\"35\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is a positive integer. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/0/d90c5f73d1d1f5d8d7c102f169ebed7ece3c0d80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_k=(-1)^k, k=1,2,\\cdots ,n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"211\" height=\"20\" />, the set of possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/f/eef0203e65664bd00b5f0325c5c5fcd81bcead8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"38\" height=\"20\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/c/f1c71f160566c3f9363dec811a10f55b58ef91e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } \\{0\\}\\quad \\text{(B) } \\{\\frac{1}{n}\\}\\quad \\text{(C) } \\{0,-\\frac{1}{n}\\}\\quad \\text{(D) } \\{0,\\frac{1}{n}\\}\\quad \\text{(E) } \\{1,\\frac{1}{n}\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"443\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because we start with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/3/cf393d6d247d180618a1ecae1f74f6cf57b77ac6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"17\" />, and the terms <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/d/f5d3dead9cb8d5f6327c737e014850be7a29d0f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"10\" /> alternate between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />, there is either one more <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> than the number of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s (when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is odd), or there are an equal number of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />s (when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is even). In the former case, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/5/b1579552b38417da727fba2b24b663924c04b70e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n)=\\frac{-1}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"89\" height=\"38\" />, and, in the latter case, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/c/63ca62369ad0c0587639f57d93a243816307b960.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" />. This is only consistent with answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/7/ef7ef72cd47d554d4b473d7e68935e75a19c0e7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"25\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME\" title=\"1968 AHSME\">1968 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1968 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1968\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" ali